    title: "DECISION: 33 third-party rows still ship in go.yaml (unix 27, grpc functions 3, execabs 3) — reachable, unlike the 20 INV-safig moved, so culling deletes 13 measured chains. ADR-0016 §27 compliance vs default detection"  # 7a8a
